sections.text:
Bought on credit:
• debit the asset account with the amount excluding tax (e.g. {'245 Transport equipment'});
• debit {'4451 VAT recoverable on fixed assets'} with the VAT;
• credit {'481 Suppliers of fixed assets'} with the amount including tax.
When the supplier is paid: debit {'481'}, credit {'521 Bank'}. Paid at once: credit {'521 Bank'} directly instead of {'481'}.
